QUESTION 2B: Has this distribution shifted in last 3 years?
: The hospitality review ecosystem has shifted over the last three years, characterized by the aggressive growth of Google Reviews at the expense of traditional travel OTAs. Google's global hotel review volume grew by 15.7% year-over-year in 2025. In 2023, Booking.com led Google by 1.6 million reviews in Shiji's global sample, but by 2025, that gap narrowed dramatically to just 627,000 reviews. Regionally, Google has captured substantial market share: in Latin America, Google surged to a 46% market share as of Q3 2025 (a 6 percentage point increase from the previous quarter). In North America, Google grew by +4.7 percentage points to capture 23% of the market. Conversely, traditional channels are contracting: Agoda's review volume declined globally, dropping by -22.8% in APAC in 2025.   

